{"case_ids": ["TC-005"], "content_sha256": "af6ab55a9aef4bb66ee375f948055c5a4cca36cdd76c33bcca4c3900e2dc0bea", "identity": {"parents": ["d6bcc16c4d3a8f331d598ea6f6a950e7eb7304ec"], "project": "soso_data_center", "sha": "2c70dbdb5d8589ca53701656dd3965806af625a8"}, "notes": ["project_scope_is_repo_name"], "refs": ["E5"], "sender": null, "sender_quality": "missing", "source": "gitlab", "source_key": "gitlab:soso_data_center:2c70dbdb5d8589ca53701656dd3965806af625a8", "source_time_iso": "2026-11-18T15:48:09+08:00", "source_time_raw": "2026-11-18T07:48:09Z", "text": "表格切片修复：分隔行识别、真实表头继承、空壳行与<br>清理、禁表格上下文拼接（禅道 #14686）\n- normalize_table_md：识别「分隔行在首行」的 OXR 形态，移位为真实表头在前、分隔行随后；单元格内 <br> 变体替换为空格；全空壳行继续丢弃\n- split_table_md：按位置定位表头+分隔行，超长拆段时每段重复真实表头+分隔行，段内不残留多余分隔行\n- normalize_table_blocks：无表头结构的续块从前一个带表头的 table 块继承；整篇无表头时不凭空拼分隔行\n- build_chunks_dg：表格切片不再拼「前文/后文上下文」，避免同表尾行重复进切片\n- 新增 tests/test_table_md.py（17 例）：首行分隔行、跨块表头、无表头、合并单元格、xlsx/docx/pdf 形态、<br> 清理、上下文禁拼、幂等\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>", "time_precision": "seconds", "time_source_field": "CommitDate", "verifiable": true}
{"case_ids": ["TC-005"], "content_sha256": "d80c07b430de29fe97cb2003025b6884c938ae48ebc67d131a58834a2d51429c", "identity": {"parents": ["2c70dbdb5d8589ca53701656dd3965806af625a8"], "project": "soso_data_center", "sha": "1388d788f0fbcf670e1eaf45b6f1ec40d36acda7"}, "notes": ["project_scope_is_repo_name"], "refs": ["E6"], "sender": null, "sender_quality": "missing", "source": "gitlab", "source_key": "gitlab:soso_data_center:1388d788f0fbcf670e1eaf45b6f1ec40d36acda7", "source_time_iso": "2026-11-18T15:48:16+08:00", "source_time_raw": "2026-11-18T07:48:16Z", "text": "补表格切片回归测试（禅道 #14686）：首行分隔行/跨块表头/无表头/合并单元格/多形态/<br>清理/上下文禁拼\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>", "time_precision": "seconds", "time_source_field": "CommitDate", "verifiable": true}
{"case_ids": ["TC-005"], "content_sha256": "47a7d6bfc7bcb2dbed7dfc61d107dd49254f3a934f386de23a2bd66b72cbdc7e", "identity": {"parents": ["1388d788f0fbcf670e1eaf45b6f1ec40d36acda7"], "project": "soso_data_center", "sha": "fd011006a3ba67d84a971c3e6c2da3747b4378ca"}, "notes": ["project_scope_is_repo_name"], "refs": ["E7"], "sender": null, "sender_quality": "missing", "source": "gitlab", "source_key": "gitlab:soso_data_center:fd011006a3ba67d84a971c3e6c2da3747b4378ca", "source_time_iso": "2026-11-18T16:52:47+08:00", "source_time_raw": "2026-11-18T08:52:47Z", "text": "fix(dc): 表格表头继承被非表格块打断时重置（#14686 复测反馈）\nnormalize_table_blocks 遇到非 table 块时重置 prev_head_prefix：\n中间隔了正文/标题后，下一张无表头的表是另一张表，不再继承\n上一张表的表头；紧邻续块的继承行为不变。\n\n补回归用例 test_header_inheritance_broken_by_non_table_block\n（table→text→table(no header) 保持自身数据行 + 连续继承仍有效）。", "time_precision": "seconds", "time_source_field": "CommitDate", "verifiable": true}
{"case_ids": ["TC-005"], "content_sha256": "c09368012f96785a9e9b6a5d2854e76af9a13838cd15250a12ee43337a47ef72", "identity": {"parents": ["9ce3998146cb0d9295565a8abaa3ab4b0a5fa38a"], "project": "soso_data_center", "sha": "2ac5f64a500d8f1222ebb0c49ed5217759893e07"}, "notes": ["project_scope_is_repo_name"], "refs": ["E8"], "sender": null, "sender_quality": "missing", "source": "gitlab", "source_key": "gitlab:soso_data_center:2ac5f64a500d8f1222ebb0c49ed5217759893e07", "source_time_iso": "2026-11-18T19:21:35+08:00", "source_time_raw": "2026-11-18T11:21:35Z", "text": "fix(dc): 表格切片在 naive/md/table/image 切片器同样不拼前文上下文（禅道 #14686）\nxlsx 默认类目走 naive 切片器，此前只改了 dg：长表切片仍以「【前文上下文】上一段尾行」开头，\n同批行在切片里重复出现，命中行被顶出首屏。本次把 dg 的口径同步到会处理表格块的\nmd / naive / table / image 四个切片器：表格切片只保留（标题）+（表头+分隔行+数据行），\n图片块仍保留上下文。\n\n补参数化用例覆盖 5 个切片器的「表格切片无上下文/表格正文首行是真实表头」，\n以及长表拆段后 naive 每段都以真实表头开头；dc-server 全量 105 passed。", "time_precision": "seconds", "time_source_field": "CommitDate", "verifiable": true}
